layer('EV29','Offline controls and model quality','offline',allf,['T1','T2','T3','T4.1','T4.2','T4.3','T5'],['C1','C2','C3','C4','C5','C6','C7','C8'],'Execute EV1-EV28 in adapter sandbox and model replay, deterministic clock and crash injection at reserve/dispatch/commit/outbox boundaries. Add generated interval/rounding tests around 59/60/61 minutes, cap±1, currency mismatch, original-line mismatch, simultaneous cancellation and schema failures.','No unauthorized/wrong/duplicate write, exact money/identity/records; model citations and abstention independently rated.','100% golden financial/state assertions; zero critical defects. C3 citation factual precision >=98% and contradictory-evidence abstention >=95%, proposed thresholds; supervisor adjudicates disagreements.','Assertions passed / assertions; factual claims supported / audited claims','100% control suite; language thresholds hypotheses pending owner approval','Versioned synthetic EV1-EV28 plus consented deidentified shadow strata: outage/speed/billing, multiple connections, language, missing data, long human wait. Sample-size powered from baseline rather than invented evidence count.','Two billing/CX reviewers label independently; third policy owner adjudicates; preserve disagreement and source refs.','Every change and nightly regression','Any financial invariant failure blocks release; language threshold miss keeps assist-only.')
layer('EV30','Online operating and safety signals','online',allf,['T1','T2','T3','T4.1','T4.2','T4.3','T5'],['C1','C2','C3','C4','C5','C6','C7','C8'],'Read journal/ledger/outbox and queue event streams; daily tenant-scoped invariant scan and stratified explanation audit.','Reconcile every dispatch to one proof or owned pending record; all due updates and deadlines owned.','Any wrong-subject, duplicate, stale unauthorized credit or false completion stops new writes immediately; retain read-only recon. Alert duty lead at 15m unacked, 36h due escalation, 48h overdue or unknown. Audit report freshness daily.','Unsafe credit count; unknown age; deadline ownership; factual precision','Zero unsafe writes/false completions; every overdue item owned; p95 investigation <=30s hypothesis','All credits and human queues; daily sampled explanations stratified by issue/language/evidence availability','Automated invariants; CX adjudication for explanation truth against source records.','Continuous critical events; daily scan and audit','One safety event disables new C6 dispatch; billing incident lead investigates and reconciles. Notification failures alert CX after three attempts.')
